      "summary": "S1: Missing channel_basket_id in S1003 file breaks deduplication for 82 rows\n\nThe S1003_20260616_0216_MOBILE.txt file renamed channel_basket_id to basket_ref, causing it to violate the raw.transactions contract: the required column channel_basket_id is missing and an unexpected column basket_ref appears. As a result, 82 rows landed with a null dedup key, preventing deduplication for this batch. Additionally, LOC-0517 reports sales under two outlet IDs (OUT-1017 and OUT-1071), affecting 251 of 8,373 deduplicated rows (3.0%) between 2026-06-01 and 2026-06-21. A resend of S1002_20260612_1120_ECOMM.txt superseded 88 rows, with 3 rows having differing qty or amount, and these changes reached fct_daily_sales. Finally, S1001_20260618_0638_POSFEED.txt delivered only 110 rows\u201440% below its 7\u2011day average of 182.6\u2014and arrived 161 minutes after the submitter SLA.",
